'''Manic Lion Cat''' (大狂乱のネコライオン ''Dai Kyōran no Neko Raion'', '''''Manic Lion Cat''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Lots O' Lion (Deadly)|Lots O' Lion]], [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 41|Floor 41]] and [[Infernal Tower]] [[Infernal Tower/Floor 31|Floor 31]] and [[Infernal Tower/Floor 41|Floor 41]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

